270
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:38,320
will be yours.

271
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:07,160
Jue Ming Valley
Country of Zhao

272
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,710
I must get the jade with my Soul Blood.

273
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:15,710
It should be doable with my cultivation.

274
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:15,710
What do we do now, Elder Mu Rong ?

275
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,110
Mu Rong, act now.

276
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:20,870
We must seize Wang Lin's body.

277
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,830
I must thank you all

278
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:28,550
for contributing to the Jue Ming battle.

279
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:29,360
Elder Mu Rong ?

280
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:30,990
Elder, what are you doing ?!

281
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,670
No, my Soul Blood !

282
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:42,510
You're dead !

283
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,320
The Corpse Puppets are waking up,

284
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,240
be careful !

285
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:53,080
What is this purple mist !?

286
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,870
All their puppets rebelled.

287
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,470
Uncle, save me !

288
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,470
You reap

289
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:25,390
what you sow.

290
00:17:44,650 --> 00:19:46,530
Country ranks are granted by the Cultivation Alliance. They correspond to the highest level cultivator there is in that specific country.
rank 1 = Foundation Establishment
rank 2 = Core Formation
rank 3 = Nascent Soul
rank 4 = Soul Formation
rank 5 = Soul Transformation
rank 6 = Ascendant
Rank 6 countries are given a planet by the Cultivation Alliance and they manage rank 5 countries. Rank 5 countries manage rank 4 countries and so on and so forth.

291
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:55,800
I've been walking this path for endless years

292
00:17:52,810 --> 00:17:55,800
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

293
00:17:56,440 --> 00:18:01,400
Is it the compass of fate

294
00:17:58,280 --> 00:18:01,400
that wrote this outcome for us ?

295
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:07,320
The heavens want to erase your existence,

296
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:13,040
that's the obsession guiding me.

297
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:18,640
Is this the path to uncover

298
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:18,640
truths from falsehoods ?

299
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:24,240
In a world of murk and shadow,

300
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:24,240
only the flame of truth can light the way.

301
00:18:24,280 --> 00:18:29,960
Look at them all,

302
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:29,960
being carried by the waves.

303
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:34,600
Look at them all,

304
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:34,600
being drowned.

305
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:37,920
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

306
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:41,000
I will let the world refine my soul.

307
00:18:41,130 --> 00:18:46,560
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

308
00:18:42,820 --> 00:18:46,560
I will fight.

309
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:49,680
I'll break through the abyss of despair

310
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:52,720
to finally learn who I really am.

311
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:58,080
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

312
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:58,080
I embrace this obsession.

313
00:18:58,080 --> 00:19:01,040
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

314
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:03,840
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

315
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:09,320
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

316
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:09,320
I'll still fight.

317
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:12,680
It's hard to avoid loneliness

318
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:15,720
when you are above everyone else.

319
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:21,400
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

320
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:21,400
be afraid of a firefly ?
